#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Aussehen"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid "Active window highlight:"
msgstr "Aktives Fenster hervorheben:"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid ""
"Colored line over the frame of the active window (the color variants of the "
"mkAurorae themes). None: the active window has the same frame as inactive "
"windows."
msgstr ""
"Farbige Linie über dem Rahmen des aktiven Fensters (die Farbvarianten der "
"mkAurorae-Designs). Keine: Das aktive Fenster hat denselben Rahmen wie "
"inaktive Fenster."

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox Active window highlight:"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keine"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox Active window highlight:"
msgid "Accent color"
msgstr "Akzentfarbe"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox Active window highlight:"
msgid "Purple"
msgstr "Lila"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox Active window highlight:"
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Rot"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox Active window highlight:"
msgid "Custom color"
msgstr "Eigene Farbe"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid "Highlight width:"
msgstr "Breite der Hervorhebung:"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid ""
"Width of the highlight line: 1 thin, 2 bold as in the B variants of the "
"mkAurorae themes, 3 and 4 grow one row further in each (4 covers the whole "
"frame)"
msgstr ""
"Breite der Hervorhebungslinie: 1 schmal, 2 breit wie bei den B-Varianten der "
"mkAurorae-Designs, 3 und 4 wachsen je eine Zeile weiter nach innen (4 "
"überdeckt den ganzen Rahmen)"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid " px"
msgstr " px"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid "Corner radius:"
msgstr "Eckradius:"

#: src/config/ui/breezeconfigurationui.ui
msgid ""
"Radius of the rounded corners of the highlight, at the outer edge of the "
"frame (the thin line starts 1 px further in: 1 px less; 0: square corners)"
msgstr ""
"Radius der abgerundeten Ecken der Hervorhebung, an der Außenkante des "
"Rahmens (die schmale Linie beginnt 1 px weiter innen: 1 px weniger; 0: eckig)"

